How do you manage Dev, QA, and Production environments using Helm?
we will write one base Helm chart, and vary the configuration using environment-specific values files.
Always deploy each environment into a isolated Kubernetes Namespace or entirely separate clusters (highly recommended for Production)
Dev: Deployed via dev context into the dev namespace.
QA: Deployed via qa context into the qa namespace.
Prod: Deployed via an isolated, secure production cluster context.
Deploy to Dev:
helm upgrade --install my-app-dev ./my-app-chart -f values-dev.yaml --namespace dev --create-namespace
Deploy to QA:
helm upgrade --install my-app-qa ./my-app-chart -f values-qa.yaml --namespace qa --create-namespace
Deploy to Production:
helm upgrade --install my-app-prod ./my-app-chart -f values-prod.yaml --namespace prod --create-namespace
